1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,142
What does an online store in Uzbekistan need to accept card payments?

2
00:00:04,142 --> 00:00:11,690
By law, only banks and payment organizations licensed by the Central Bank can connect to Uzcard and Humo, not stores.

3
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:15,059
So an acquirer has to sit between the store and the card network.

4
00:00:15,059 --> 00:00:20,464
A bank acquirer takes the card on its own secure page, and the store never sees the card number.

5
00:00:20,464 --> 00:00:24,988
The store signs one contract and gets paid into its own account at the same bank.

6
00:00:24,988 --> 00:00:28,773
But before a store takes its first payment, what does the bank check?

